# bluetooth, CA-1 kernel half: the RTL8723BS's Bluetooth is Realtek H5 on UART2
# (ttymxc1, 115200 8E1), described as a serdev child of &uart2 in the DTS. The
# kernel's hci_uart does the Realtek setup (firmware download from
# /lib/firmware/rtl_bt, then the config's baud rate) and hands the bridge hci0.
# Modules, like the Wi-Fi half: a firmware hiccup must not stall boot.
CONFIG_BT=m
CONFIG_BT_HCIBTUSB=m
CONFIG_SERIAL_DEV_BUS=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_DEV_CTRL_TTYPORT=y
CONFIG_BT_HCIUART=m
CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_3WIRE=y
CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_RTL=y
